📊 Data Analytics Project 2 — Microsoft Excel

🔎 Project Overview

This project is a practical Data Analytics project using Microsoft Excel, created as part of my Data Analytics learning journey.

The project focuses on working with raw data, organizing it properly, applying Excel formulas, and performing statistical analysis to extract meaningful information from the dataset.

---

🎯 Project Objective

The main objective of this project is to:

- Understand and organize raw data
- Perform data cleaning and sorting
- Arrange data year-wise
- Apply Excel formulas and functions
- Calculate statistical measures
- Analyze the dataset and identify useful insights

---

🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Excel
- Data Cleaning
- Data Sorting & Filtering
- Excel Formulas
- Statistical Analysis
- Data Interpretation

---

📌 Key Analysis Performed

1. Data Organization

The dataset was structured and arranged properly to make the analysis easier.

2. Year-wise Analysis

The data was arranged in sequence according to the year for better understanding and comparison.

3. Statistical Analysis

Statistical calculations were performed on the dataset, including Standard Deviation, to understand data variation.

4. Excel Formulas

Different Excel formulas and functions were used wherever required to perform calculations and analyze the data.

